      [
        "Weiqi Fu (Go Rhapsody)"
      ]
    ]
  },
  "previewImage": "",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "3d4b231f-4ecc-4e04-8cfc-1072fa6697aa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>by Ma Yong</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f54c78c-6321-4dd9-b59f-1692d26dfb17",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "07c37f3c-ac5c-4572-88b3-da42f3fe091b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c17a11bf-93e8-4113-b882-ddd88908f5b8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>First the four corners are occupied</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "951ceb64-2477-49f9-a6ca-3adcb0cdb158",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>To protect them and influence the sides,</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f2a898d-aace-497a-925f-f0b22d0de8cd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Then along the sides the lines are blocked</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "20c1b599-219c-4438-8e13-970cf24c2b21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>So that the scattered stones gaze at one another from afar.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4f125d7-1428-4031-9855-681dd8aa5826",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Then come knight's moves large and small,</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e0a7362-292a-4ab5-965d-e2f063242ebf",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Now far apart, now one on one,</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1accb84-b9b8-4bc1-8dee-b8cfcaea90f5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>As groups jump out in leaps and bounds</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2f6b71c-2510-4577-afd5-79ea74ccf016",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>And make their way into the center.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f88cf23-e408-4577-9abb-b9a39f4ce637",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Having escaped they stop and prepare to move:</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "67f6113e-b5ab-4e8f-8c1c-c3c7e4549f27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>To fly to left or right?</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "635ad617-67dd-4fb9-8559-c4db29ca888d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Where the way is narrow and the enemy more numerous</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "356a868e-1c5d-405f-b680-8d1aadd69f37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>They will be unable to go far.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "507bd764-ebe6-4dfb-b5a3-51ba8662d0e6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>But if themselves more numerous yet lacking plans,</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c2ae6e8-1e59-4d15-8143-6b5a5c43f3c8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>They will bunch aimlessly like a flock of sheep</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "fed36484-c6b9-458f-940e-29be8b6233c3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>And will forever be on the defensive</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "95b44bf3-7de8-4166-990e-e3af4acc2e3d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>As the opponent snaps at them on all sides.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "99dbe9c0-d4f3-40c1-8029-f65f07d3d656",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>Instead attack where the enemy is overstretched, seek out his defects</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "95926b17-de4c-48bb-9cd5-76d483802a06",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>And send thunderbolts crashing in to his vital points.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "53bf4924-5c26-42eb-bed0-aab828227d9d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>If there is profit, you will then have time to take it;</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "80814deb-d4a8-4889-a86e-c542d7ce70aa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>If there is opportunity, you can make yourself strong.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f61a5ad-7a77-4a6e-9303-4c74e4c2ea06",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>But if you are too greedy to capture his stones,</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb71afa9-8b1c-4640-8395-295367311e72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>He will break down your walls</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbec788c-7345-4e24-a7d3-4c71bef5020e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>And when the dike bursts it will not be stopped</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "28afea15-9461-4469-ab43-d0f4b2882a43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>But will overflow and the flood reach far and wide.</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "2068715d-5290-4114-8e59-f2a0af839e42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "57f5eade-403d-4cc6-8c51-e2db9041ca29",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
